  "text": "This thin line of clay marks the end of the dinosaurs. It's in a cliff in Italy about a centimeter thick. Below it, the rock is full of tiny fossil shells. Above it, almost all of them are gone. In 1980, scientists found the clay was packed with a rare metal from space. Something huge had hit the Earth",
